[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0615","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0615.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0830","title":"Microsoft WebTV annclist.exe UDP数据包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft WebTV for Windows 中的 annclist.exe 组件存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统的 22701 至 22705 端口发送特制的大尺寸畸形 UDP 数据包，导致 annclist.exe 进程崩溃，造成服务不可用。该漏洞影响 WebTV for Windows 98/ME 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。攻击者只需具备网络访问能力即可触发，利用门槛低，已有公开 PoC 代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0830"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:33.350","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 WebTV for Windows（Windows 98/ME 时代产品），微软未发布官方补丁。建议在防火墙或网络边界设备上添加规则，阻止外部 UDP 流量访问 22701-22705 端口；如业务已不再使用 WebTV，应直接卸载该组件或升级至受支持的 Windows 操作系统版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/81852","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1671","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-074","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5216","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20219","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0830.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0830","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0830.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0830.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-57hj-9c9v-7vhc/GHSA-57hj-9c9v-7vhc.json","https://github.com/CERTCC/SBOM/blob/ae581e32992458f65018df4eced684b7370bba39/SwiftBOM/cpe_lookup/cve_lookup/microsoft/webtv_cve.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0830.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0615.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0612","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0612.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0829","title":"Red Hat Linux tmpwatch 递归目录拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.1 中的 tmpwatch 工具在处理目录清理时存在拒绝服务漏洞。tmpwatch 会为每个目录层级 fork 一个新的子进程，本地攻击者可在 /tmp 或 /var/tmp/ 目录下创建深度嵌套的目录结构，触发大量进程 fork 操作，耗尽系统进程资源，导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，但需要本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0829"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:33.230","remediation":"建议立即应用 Red Hat 安全公告 RHSA-2000-080 提供的 tmpwatch 更新补丁，升级至修复版本。如无法立即打补丁，可采取以下缓解措施：避免使用 tmpwatch 的 --fuser 或 -s 选项；通过设置 /tmp 和 /var/tmp 目录的磁盘配额限制，防止本地用户创建过深目录层级；使用 ulimit 限制每个进程可打开的文件描述符数量，降低 fork 风暴对系统的影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-080.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/81364","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1664","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5217","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20217","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0829.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0829","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0829.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0829.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8qqw-f9rj-2mrm/GHSA-8qqw-f9rj-2mrm.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/anonymous-55443259/CVE_Vul_File_Localization/blob/24756649f99ff5cea566f1e66a7fdd2ed0e7aced/Result/repository/repository_collection/repo_from_gpt/result/CVE-2000-0829/1.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0829.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0612.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0607","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0607.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0828","title":"Mobius DocumentDirect for the Internet 1.2 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Mobius DocumentDirect for the Internet 1.2 的 ddicgi.exe 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 HTTP 请求，在 User-Agent 参数中传入超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而在服务器上以系统权限执行任意命令。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。受影响的 Mobius DocumentDirect for the Internet 1.2 版本已停止维护，建议用户升级或迁移至替代产品。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0828"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:33.107","remediation":"该产品已停止维护，建议立即卸载或禁用 ddicgi.exe 组件，改用其他受支持的文档分发方案。如无法立即卸载，可在 Web 服务器或反向代理层面添加规则，过滤包含超长 User-Agent 头的请求（限制长度不超过 256 字节），并限制 ddicgi.exe 仅允许来自可信 IP 段的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a090800-1.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1657","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5212","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20211","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0828.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0828","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0828.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0828.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-229g-v59m-656v/GHSA-229g-v59m-656v.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0828.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d5705229-879c-495d-946a-3ad6bf34297f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0607.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0607.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0607.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0604","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0604.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0824","title":"ProFTPD ProFTPd 1.2 pre6 snprintf 格式化字符串漏洞","description":"glibc 2.1.1 的 unsetenv 函数存在缺陷，当程序接收到重复的环境变量（如 LD_PRELOAD 或 LD_LIBRARY_PATH）时，未能正确清除该变量，导致本地攻击者可在 setuid 程序（如 ProFTPd 1.2 pre6 等以 root 权限运行的服务）中注入恶意共享库，进而实现本地提权至 root。该漏洞影响使用 glibc 2.1.1 的 Linux 系统，攻击者需具备本地账户权限，通过设置重复环境变量启动 setuid 程序即可触发，利用方式为构造恶意 LD_PRELOAD/LD_LIBRARY_PATH 环境变量劫持动态链接器加载恶意 so 文件实现代码执行。CVSS 7.2（本地/低复杂度/无需认证/完全影响）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0824"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:32.550","remediation":"立即升级 ProFTPd 至 1.2.0 正式版或更高版本（如 1.2.10），或升级 glibc 至 2.1.2 以上版本修复 unsetenv 漏洞。若无法立即升级，可临时在 /etc/ftpaccess 中添加 \"DenyAll\" 限制匿名访问，或在防火墙层面限制 FTP 端口 (21/tcp) 仅允许受信 IP 访问作为临时缓解措施。建议优先从 ProFTPd 官网 (http://www.proftpd.org/) 下载最新稳定版源码编译安装，或使用发行版包管理器 (如 apt upgrade proftpd / yum update proftpd) 更新至修复版本。若使用 Mandrake Linux，请安装官方安全补丁 MDKSA-2000:040。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0436.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0509.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0525.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93760201002154&w=2","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-028.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000902","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/updates/MDKSA-2000-040.php3","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/updates/MDKSA-2000-045.php3","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/adv5_draht_glibc_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-057.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/79537","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1639","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/648","http://www.turbolinux.com/pipermail/tl-security-announce/2000-September/000020.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5173","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0824.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0824","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0824.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0824.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7573-6fcp-5wh3/GHSA-7573-6fcp-5wh3.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2000-040.nasl","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0824.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0604.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0825","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0825.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0825","title":"Ipswitch Imail 6.0 长Host头导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Ipswitch Imail 6.0 邮件服务器存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过发送大量包含超长 Host 头的连接请求，导致服务器线程崩溃，从而使邮件服务不可用。攻击无需身份认证，可远程触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0825"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14","updated":"2024-06-16","remediation":"升级到 Ipswitch Imail 6.01 或更高版本；在防火墙或负载均衡器上限制同一源IP的连接速率；配置服务器连接超时参数以缓解大量连接攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2024-06-01T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q3/0071.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96659012127444&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=96654521004571&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2011","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5475"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0825.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0825.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0825.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0853","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0853.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1219","title":"GNU gcc 和 g++ 编译器整数溢出安全漏洞","description":"GCC 和 G++ 3.3.3 及更早版本中的 -ftrapv 编译选项本应用于捕获有符号整数溢出，但未能覆盖所有整数溢出类型（如无符号整数回绕及其他边界情况），导致使用该选项编译的应用程序在面对特定溢出攻击时仍存在安全隐患。攻击者可向目标程序提交特制输入触发未处理的整数溢出，可能导致程序崩溃、拒绝服务或敏感信息泄露。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1219"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2000-11-01T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:24.397","remediation":"升级 GCC 至 3.3.4 及以上版本以修复 -ftrapv 选项对部分整数溢出无法捕获的问题；对关键运算逻辑手动添加溢出检查（如 __builtin_sadd_overflow），或改用 -fsanitize=undefined 等现代检测工具替代 -ftrapv。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://gcc.gnu.org/ml/gcc-bugs/2002-05/msg00198.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/540517"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0853.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1608","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1608.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0793","title":"Symantec Norton AntiVirus Novell客户端自动防护服务失效漏洞","description":"Norton AntiVirus 5.00.01C 版本在 Novell NetWare 客户端环境下存在自动保护服务失效漏洞。当第一个用户从系统注销后，防毒软件的自动保护服务无法正常重新启动，导致后续用户登录后系统处于无防毒保护状态。攻击者利用此漏洞需具备本地登录权限，在用户注销后即可绕过防毒软件的实时监控，使系统暴露于恶意软件威胁之下。该漏洞影响 Norton AntiVirus 5.00.01C 及可能的相关版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0793"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:29.560","remediation":"立即将 Norton AntiVirus for Novell Netware 升级至 5.00.02 或更高版本，该版本已修复用户注销后自动保护服务无法重启的问题。如无法升级，可在系统登录脚本中添加 `navapstart` 命令强制重启自动保护服务，或在用户注销后手动重启 Norton Auto-Protect 服务。鉴于该产品已停止支持，建议迁移至 Symantec Endpoint Protection 14.3 以上版本或当前受支持的端点防护方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1533","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=398222C5%40zathras.cc.vt.edu","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0793.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0793","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0793.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0793.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4d465198ab8436491a7618e7789ef7adce4c01e0/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r8m5-3xgx-3jm2/GHSA-r8m5-3xgx-3jm2.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1533/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0793.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--24f89bca-9dcb-44d4-9b28-412daff5cd83.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f352dfaf39e3e89c1c3ab384d9e74e4219126910/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1608.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1606","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1606.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0788","title":"Microsoft Word 邮件合并工具远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Word 的邮件合并功能在处理 Access 数据库时，未在执行其中嵌入的 Visual Basic (VBA) 脚本前向用户弹出安全提示，导致攻击者可通过构造恶意的 Access 数据库文件，诱使用户在 Word 中执行邮件合并操作，从而在用户系统上以当前用户权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Office 系列产品，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。由于 VBA 脚本具有完整的系统访问能力，成功利用可导致数据泄露、系统控制权丧失等严重后果。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0788"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:28.940","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-071 提供的补丁：Word 2000 用户安装 KB274226 更新，Word 97 用户安装 KB272749 更新。该补丁会强制对 Access 邮件合并数据源进行区域检查，阻止来自 Internet 或受限站点区域的数据库自动执行 VBA 脚本。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙层面阻止对 135-139 和 445 端口的入站和出站流量，阻断远程 UNC 路径对恶意 Access 数据库的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1566","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=398EB9CA.27E03A9C%40nat.bg","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-071","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5322","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-0619.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0788.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0788","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0788.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0788.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/711263a5c057385b05d3b3d477c7a317d9a9f37f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jq7r-5rhw-2vvw/GHSA-jq7r-5rhw-2vvw.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0619.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0788.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_148900_149000.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1606.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1600","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1600.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0784","title":"Rapidstream sshd 硬编码空密码远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Rapidstream 2.1 Beta VPN 设备中的 sshd 程序存在硬编码后门账户漏洞，系统内置了名为 \"rsadmin\" 的默认管理员账户且密码为空字符串。远程攻击者无需任何身份认证，即可通过 SSH 服务直接使用该空密码账户登录目标设备，获得完全的管理员权限，进而执行任意系统命令、窃取敏感数据或控制整个设备。该漏洞影响 Rapidstream 2.1 Beta 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。厂商至今未发布官方补丁，建议立即更换受影响的设备或禁用 SSH 服务并配置严格的访问控制策略。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0784"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:28.447","remediation":"立即禁用或删除 Rapidstream 2.1 Beta VPN 设备中硬编码的 \"rsadmin\" 账户，或为其设置强密码。如设备支持，升级到已修复此问题的官方固件版本。若无法升级，在防火墙上限制 SSH 端口的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理地址连接，并启用 SSH 登录日志审计以检测异常登录行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0216.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1574","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0784.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0784","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0784.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0784.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a63d131cc61df62c077c7700617ad6343ec52ef/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x4qg-m523-2cjh/GHSA-x4qg-m523-2cjh.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1574/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0784.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f272ba63-89a6-4982-80aa-e4eac50e9864.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--f272ba63-89a6-4982-80aa-e4eac50e9864.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1600.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1520","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1520.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0762","title":"CA eTrust Access Control 默认加密密钥认证绕过漏洞","description":"eTrust Access Control（原名 SeOS）默认安装使用了固定的默认加密密钥，远程攻击者可利用该密钥伪造 eTrust 管理员身份，从而获取系统完全控制权限。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响系统的机密性、完整性和可用性。厂商建议用户立即修改默认加密密钥以降低风险。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0762"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:25.690","remediation":"立即修改 eTrust Access Control 默认加密密钥，在配置文件中设置自定义密钥而非使用出厂默认值；将产品升级至 Broadcom 官方提供的最新受支持版本（4.1/5.0 已停止维护，建议迁移至 CA Access Control 最新版本）；在网络层面限制对 eTrust 管理端口的访问，仅允许受信任管理 IP 通过防火墙规则连接，并启用 TLS 加密通信防止中间人攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.ca.com/techbases/eTrust/etrust_access_control-response.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1517","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1583","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=004601c003a1%24ba473260%24ddeaa2cd%40itradefair.net","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5076","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0762.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0762","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0762.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0762.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9j8x-rg33-7fqr/GHSA-9j8x-rg33-7fqr.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0762.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6015773b-aa8e-4a2d-8cdb-42c09a095cdf.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1520.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1509","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1509.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0747","title":"Conectiva Linux OpenLDAP logrotate脚本信号处理不当拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Conectiva Linux 中 OpenLDAP 1.2.11 之前版本的 logrotate 脚本存在信号处理不当漏洞。该脚本在日志轮转过程中向系统内核日志守护进程（klogd）发送了错误的信号，导致 klogd 进程异常终止，造成系统日志记录功能失效。本地攻击者可通过触发日志轮转操作（如使系统日志文件增长至触发轮转条件）利用此漏洞，使目标系统失去日志审计能力，进而掩盖后续攻击行为。该漏洞影响 Conectiva Linux 系统上安装了受影响 OpenLDAP 版本的所有配置。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0747"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:23.810","remediation":"升级 OpenLDAP 至 1.2.11 或更高版本，该版本修复了 logrotate 脚本向 klogd 发送错误信号的问题。如无法升级，手动编辑 OpenLDAP 的 logrotate 配置文件（通常位于 /etc/logrotate.d/openldap），移除或修正其中向 klogd 发送信号的命令（如 kill -HUP），改为正确的信号或直接注释该行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0379.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5036","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0747.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0747","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0747.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0747.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wvg7-5q5w-jh2m/GHSA-wvg7-5q5w-jh2m.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88329/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0747.json","https://github.com/x-s-g/Vuln-Intro/blob/aa42031a1aaff880d1d582777ef18a1a29cbebc3/Dataset/Dataset/CVE_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1509.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1508","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1508.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0746","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 和 5.0 的 shtml.dll 组件在处理错误消息时未对用户输入进行正确转义，存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可将恶意脚本嵌入指向受信任站点的链接中，当用户访问该链接时，IIS 返回的错误消息未对脚本进行引号转义处理，导致脚本在用户浏览器中以受信任站点的上下文执行，从而窃取 Cookie、会话令牌或执行其他恶意操作。攻击者需诱使用户点击特制链接，无需身份认证即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0746"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:23.690","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-060 提供的修补程序（IIS 4.0 对应 KB260347，IIS 5.0 对应 KB275657）。如无法安装补丁，部署 URLScan 工具过滤恶意 HTML 标签，并在应用层对所有用户输入执行 HTML 编码。鉴于 IIS 4.0/5.0 已停止支持，建议升级至 IIS 7.0 及以上版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1594","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1595","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=39A12BD6.E811BF4F%40nat.bg","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-060","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0746.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0746","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0746.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0746.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/frontpage_xss.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-68vx-xw79-w5cg/GHSA-68vx-xw79-w5cg.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0746.yaml","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2009/remote-MS00-060.nasl","https://github.com/chihsuan/search-engine/blob/9dcdd3e644469883f53565740f0ba8ff617c5120/Data/E99D88C1-C798-40D7-BB8C-47E6405B9469.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1104.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1508.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1506","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1506.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0713","title":"Adobe Acrobat 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Acrobat 4.05、Reader、Business Tools 及 Fill In 等 PDF 处理产品中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过向 PDF 文件中的 /Registry 或 /Ordering 说明符提供超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Adobe Acrobat 系列 PDF 处理软件，攻击者只需构造特制 PDF 文件诱使用户打开即可完成利用，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0713"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:19.503","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Acrobat / Reader 至 5.0 及以上版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。对于无法升级的旧系统，建议停用 PDF 解析功能或更换为其他 PDF 阅读器，并在应用层过滤包含超长 /Registry 或 /Ordering 字段的 PDF 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0382.html","http://www.adobe.com/misc/pdfsecurity.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1509","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0713.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0713","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0713.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0713.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee6027